            "value": [
              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The data presented here was collected as part of the PICKA project:\n</br>\n<strong>gen_responses_laptop.csv and gen_responses_sam.csv</strong>:\n</br>\nCSV files with results of normal-hearing adults' categorizations of voice gender as a function of F0 and VTL when using the laptop and NAO robot, respectively.\n<br/>\n<strong>jnd_rseponses_laptop.csv and jnd_rseponses_sam.csv</strong>:\n<br/>\nCSV files with results of normal-hearing adults' just noticeable differences in fundamental frequency (F0) and vocal tract length (VTL) when using the laptop and NAO robot, respectively.\n<strong>emo_response_laptop.csv and emo_response_sam.csv</strong>:\n<br/>\nCSV files with results of normal hearing adults' voice emotion recognition data when using the laptop and the NAO robot, respectively."
                }
              }
            ]
